    "Stationary procedural chart on an unworn headset; not gameplay, perceptual or sustained thermal validation.",
    "Displayed target FPS counts frames that reached the client compositor; not optical display FPS.",
    "Estimated pipeline latency is ALVR's statistic, not measured motion-to-photon latency.",
    "Each session is a few minutes; battery was not charging over USB (46%)."
